# BUSINESS CONTEXT

There are two companies inside the same Odoo 19 Community database.

## Company A

**PT Kalimasada Indonesia**

This company acts as the purchasing company.

## Company B

**imen.co.id**

This company acts as the selling company.

Both companies exist inside the same Odoo database using Odoo Multi-Company.

The business requirement is to create an integrated intercompany transaction flow.

