# IMPORTANT INVOICE RULE

Do NOT treat a draft invoice as equivalent to a posted invoice.

Explicitly distinguish:

```text
Invoice Draft
Invoice Posted
Invoice Cancelled
Credit Note
```

The architecture must define exactly when the invoice becomes eligible to create the vendor bill.

Recommended default:

```text
Customer Invoice
      │
      ├── Draft
      │     └── No Vendor Bill yet
      │
      └── Posted
            │
            ▼
      Intercompany Invoice Bridge
            │
            ▼
      Vendor Bill
```

The system must NOT create a financial vendor bill prematurely from an unposted invoice unless explicitly configured.

